  values ('ME', 'short_answer', 'The diagram shows a simple distillation apparatus. Write down the names of the parts labelled 1-9 (the diagram need not be drawn). (3 marks)', '1 - Bunsen burner (source of heat), with wire gauze on a tripod.
2 - Distillation (round-bottom) flask containing the mixture.
3 - Still head (distillation head) connecting the flask to the condenser.
4 - Thermometer, with its bulb level with the side arm, to read the boiling point of the vapour.
5 - Liebig condenser.
6 - Cooling water inlet (at the lower end of the condenser).
7 - Cooling water outlet (at the upper end).
8 - Receiving flask collecting the distillate.
9 - Vent (vacuum adapter outlet) open to the air, so pressure does not build up.', null, '[{"point": "1 Bunsen burner (heat source); 2 distillation (round-bottom) flask; 3 still head (distillation head/adapter)", "marks": 1}, {"point": "4 thermometer; 5 Liebig condenser; 6 cooling water in", "marks": 1}, {"point": "7 cooling water out; 8 receiving flask (distillate); 9 vent/vacuum adapter outlet", "marks": 1}]'::jsonb, (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'general-subject-knowledge'),
